<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Isabel rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Isabel rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Flemings Research reaffirmed its buy recommendation on Chilean supermarket chain Santa Isabel.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We find that the fundamental outlook for Santa Isabel, both in FY96 and FY97, has not changed significantly,'' despite tight monetary policy in Chile and a more pronounced than expected slowdown in Peru, said Flemings.</p>
<p>-- The share's recent price weakness was unwarranted, it said.</p>
<p>-- Santiago Newsroom 56-2-6995595 x211</p>
</text>
